02   WordPress Blogs Hacked

      For the past two weeks we've been battling WordPress hacks and
attacks that have affected thousands of blogs. Fortunately, they
did not get UGNN. However they did get several other sites we
administer, and it's not a pretty sight. Network Solutions
was hacked twice in ten days, and they don't seem to be
able to stay ahead of the hackers.

http://www.ugnn.com/2010/04/wordpress-blogs-hacked/

-------------------------------------------------------------------

03  iPad on a roll, good and bad

