Date: Tue, 3 Sep 2002 13:13:17 -0400
From: Arielle <gm@wknc.org>
Subject: RE: KNC Stream [1:51144:51751]

This message was sent from: WKNC Chat.
<http://wknc.org/forum/read.php?f=1&i=51751&t=51144> 
