<a name=""When:2:31:27PM""><a href=""http://www.nytimes.com/2002/07/30/nyregion/30MAN.html?ex=1028692800&en=1f0fdbe386a7f981&ei=5007&partner=USERLAND"">Joel Klein</a>, Microsoft's chief prosecutor in the Clinton Administration, is <a href=""http://www.nytimes.com/2002/07/30/nyregion/30CITI.html?ex=1028692800&en=58032270ad37c1b3&ei=5007&partner=USERLAND"">named</a> <a href=""http://www.nytimes.com/2002/07/30/nyregion/30SCHO.html?ex=1028692800&en=222f7c75dd59fdb2&ei=5007&partner=USERLAND"">chancellor</a> of New York's public school system.&nbsp;<a href=""http://scriptingnews.userland.com/backissues/2002/07/30#When:2:31:27PM"" title=""Permanent link to this item in archive.""><img src=""http://www.scripting.com/images/2001/09/20/sharpPermaLink3.gif"" height=""9"" width=""6"" border=""0""></a><br><br>
<a name=""When:12:21:11PM"">It's been one week since Salon's blogs booted up. Scott Rosenberg posts a <a href=""http://blogs.salon.com/0000014/2002/07/30.html#a40"">progress report</a>. &nbsp;<a href=""http://scriptingnews.userland.com/backissues/2002/07/30#When:12:21:11PM"" title=""Permanent link to this item in archive.""><img src=""http://www.scripting.com/images/2001/09/20/sharpPermaLink3.gif"" height=""9"" width=""6"" border=""0""></a><br><br>
<a name=""When:1:52:10PM""><a href=""http://blogs.salon.com/0001107/2002/07/30.html#a10"">FarrFeed</a>: ""I love this stuff.""&nbsp;<a href=""http://scriptingnews.userland.com/backissues/2002/07/30#When:1:52:10PM"" title=""Permanent link to this item in archive.""><img src=""http://www.scripting.com/images/2001/09/20/sharpPermaLink3.gif"" height=""9"" width=""6"" border=""0""></a><br><br>
