<font size=""+1""><b>Clone, clone, clone your disks</b></a></font><br>



Imaging software can help you roll out new systems faster, right? The catch is that fine print requirement for ""identical client hardware."" But Tech Update's <b>Lee Schlesinger</b> says new technology from IBM may be a quantum leap for disk imaging. 

<br><img src=""http://www.zdnet.com/techupdate/i/arrow_blue.gif"" width=""8"" height=""10"" border=""0"">
