<b>Microsoft squashes Windows 2000 bugs</b></a>

<p>

<!--STORY 2-->
 
 <table cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" border=""0"" width=""85"" align=""right"">
<tr valign=top>

<td>
  <img src=""http://techupdate.zdnet.com/techupdate/i/071702_ballmer_quote.gif"" width=""220"" height=""150"" border=""0"" align=""right"">
